/** Draw a card with its top left at (x, y): opts { size ('large', 'medium', 'small'; the first the cart made by default),
 * down (face down: the back), prio (default 3) }. Faces are copied from the ROM into a sprite slot when first needed
 * and stay there while they are drawn; the least recently drawn slot is reused. Returns false if every slot of that
 * size already shows another card this frame (art.cards(slots=...) sets how many: one for each face on screen). */
